[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=flockswitch
Comment=Move your Logitech mouse and keyboard to another computer with one button
Comment[ko]=버튼 하나로 Logitech 마우스와 키보드를 다른 컴퓨터로 함께 옮깁니다
Exec=@BIN@
Icon=@ICON@
